  "summary": "The experiment tested an image-only model using ResNet50, achieving validation accuracy of 0.2079 and F1 of 0.1718, lower than the RNA-only baseline (0.4849). This suggests RNA data may contribute more to performance, but the effectiveness of multimodal integration remains uncertain due to lack of direct comparison between image-only and RNA-only configurations in prior experiments."
